From 618ed45861263e358898847458242005f3923a04 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Varun-iiitb <var3907@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:35:54 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 31/58] Build: allow per-ABI APKs (flutter build apk
 --split-per-abi)

Fix round 2, F10. Flutter's --split-per-abi (-Psplit-per-abi=true) sets
splits.abi, which Gradle refuses next to the release build type's
ndk.abiFilters ("Conflicting configuration ... cannot be present when
splits abi filters are set"), even for a profile build. The filter now
applies only when no split is requested; other builds are unchanged.

Profile build, per ABI (pad-2026.10.5 with the int8 SFace):
- arm64-v8a 158,607,245 bytes (151.3 MiB);
- armeabi-v7a 145,315,101 bytes (138.6 MiB);
- x86_64 167,078,781 bytes (159.3 MiB).
Before: one arm64-targeted profile APK of 268,494,217 bytes (256 MiB,
four-model bundle), which shipped ONNX Runtime for all four ABIs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 android/app/build.gradle | 10 +++++++---
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/android/app/build.gradle b/android/app/build.gradle
index 2ebd645..f7a0764 100644
--- a/android/app/build.gradle
+++ b/android/app/build.gradle
@@ -112,9 +112,13 @@ android {
             minifyEnabled false
             shrinkResources false
             signingConfig localProperties['storeFile'] ? signingConfigs.release : signingConfigs.debug
-            ndk {
-                abiFilters 'arm64-v8a', 'armeabi-v7a', 'x86_64', 'x86'
-                // architectures: 'armeabi-v7a', 'arm64-v8a', 'armeabi', 'x86', 'x86_64'
+            // flutter build apk --split-per-abi (-Psplit-per-abi=true) sets splits.abi, which Gradle refuses next to
+            // ndk.abiFilters; one APK per ABI is the recommended distribution (Mosip26 docs/part5-android-benchmark.md).
+            if (!project.hasProperty('split-per-abi')) {
+                ndk {
+                    abiFilters 'arm64-v8a', 'armeabi-v7a', 'x86_64', 'x86'
+                    // architectures: 'armeabi-v7a', 'arm64-v8a', 'armeabi', 'x86', 'x86_64'
+                }
             }
         }
     }
